'''Eden of Evolution''' (変異を伴う継承の楽園, ''Hen'i o Tomonau Keishō no Rakuen'', '''Paradise of Succession with Mutation''') is the 31st sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 129th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Similar to [[Truth's Devouring Maw]] and [[Garden of Wilted Thoughts]] in that there are 5 moderately difficult stages as well as a [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] stage that serves as challenging wall for progression. [[Sage of Selection Darvin]] can be very challenging without hyper-specific [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] to counter him, so don't underestimate this sub-chapter.

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Sage of Selection Darvin]]: An incredibly resilient [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] enemy who attacks somewhat slowly, only moves at 4 speed and has 350 range, but hits units in an area of 1~401 for 40k damage, then hits those at 401~651 for 20k. Both hits curse units for 3 seconds and delay their ongoing cooldowns by 50% of their current cooldowns.

This sub-chapter also includes a new obtainable unit, [[Master of Selection Darvin (Special Cat)|Master of Selection Darvin]]. He has a 30% chance to drop from the final stage (100% if a [[Treasure Radar]] is used).

